  "name": "Restoration and Renewal Client Board",
  "parent_committee_id": null,
  "purpose": "<p>The R&amp;R Client Board, made up of members of both Houses’ Commissions, is responsible for making critical strategic choices and recommendations relating to the restoration and renewal of the Palace of Westminster.The Committee published its&nbsp;<a href=\"https://committees.parliament.uk/committee/616/restoration-and-renewal-client-board/publications/reports-responses/\">report on costed proposals in multiple formats</a>&nbsp;on 5 February 2026.</p>",
